WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:05.047
In 2014, two years after
they first started dating,

00:00:06.173 --> 00:00:08.258
mum and David
left the house.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.637
Nobody knew
where they'd gone.

00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:20.229
When Sandra left,

00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:22.564
I didn't think that'd be
the last time

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:24.691
that me or my children
would see her.

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:29.446
I went back into the house

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:30.948
to get the house ready
for sale.

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:35.369
I was completely horrified
and shocked to see

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:37.246
that on the master bedroom

00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:41.333
there was a huge,
industrial size padlock.

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:45.003
That's the kind of lock
you have

00:00:45.087 --> 00:00:47.172
on an outside
garage or a locker.

00:00:49.007 --> 00:00:49.842
The door would give way

00:00:49.925 --> 00:00:51.009
before the lock
would give way.

00:00:51.635 --> 00:00:55.597
That is to keep a person in
or out of that room.

00:00:57.266 --> 00:00:59.601
There was newspaper.

00:01:00.519 --> 00:01:03.397
Completely covered the whole
window in its entirety.

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:05.148
So no one on the outside

00:01:05.232 --> 00:01:08.026
could see through what was
happening inside this room.

00:01:10.529 --> 00:01:13.031
I just think it's very
disturbing and sinister

00:01:13.115 --> 00:01:15.742
that you would go to
the extremes to

00:01:15.826 --> 00:01:17.661
A. Block the inside of
the house from outside

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.830
and B. Put a lock
of that sub--

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:21.540
A substantial lock
inside the house.

00:01:35.846 --> 00:01:40.142
I was surprised of the mail
that was at the house.

00:01:41.143 --> 00:01:44.313
There was absolutely
every single bill

00:01:44.396 --> 00:01:46.773
and red letter
of final demand

00:01:46.857 --> 00:01:49.026
and court summons
that you could imagine.

00:01:50.694 --> 00:01:52.487
There's so many
letters here.

00:01:52.571 --> 00:01:54.323
Bills and electricity
company.

00:01:54.907 --> 00:01:56.617
From the phone company.

00:01:56.700 --> 00:02:00.037
From the local
borough council.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.705
Penalty for a parking fine,

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:03.999
tax credits where they're
recovering the money back.

00:02:04.082 --> 00:02:06.168
Credit card details.

00:02:06.835 --> 00:02:08.045
More parking fines.

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:10.506
Here's one about
the mortgage company.

00:02:10.589 --> 00:02:13.592
So, the mortgage hadn't been
paid for many, many months.

00:02:14.301 --> 00:02:15.135
Wow.

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:18.388
Sandra didn't have an
overdraft or a credit card

00:02:18.472 --> 00:02:19.598
before she knew him.

00:02:19.681 --> 00:02:22.059
So, this sad state
of financial affairs,

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:23.852
in my opinion, has all
been brought on by David.

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:28.398
The car that your mum
and David had been driving,

00:02:28.482 --> 00:02:30.651
finance on the car not paid.

00:02:30.734 --> 00:02:32.819
You're talking about
£35,000 car.

00:02:32.903 --> 00:02:34.112
It was top of the line.

00:02:34.196 --> 00:02:35.697
The car was a present
for my mum

00:02:35.781 --> 00:02:37.741
but financed in her name.

00:02:38.367 --> 00:02:40.619
Affectively given a car
she had to pay for.

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:42.663
He always told us

00:02:42.746 --> 00:02:44.706
that he was doing
very well for himself

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:47.042
and, you know,
buying flash cars,

00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:49.378
having, you know,
expensive watches

00:02:49.461 --> 00:02:53.006
and looking through this,
it was all faked.

00:02:57.511 --> 00:02:59.221
My mum was an only child.

00:03:00.097 --> 00:03:02.599
She was very close
with her parents.

00:03:04.893 --> 00:03:06.395
My nan and grandad,

00:03:06.478 --> 00:03:08.188
both sadly passed away,

00:03:08.272 --> 00:03:11.692
and my mum didn't turn up
to their funerals.

00:03:12.693 --> 00:03:15.070
It was so out of character,

00:03:15.153 --> 00:03:18.282
but deep down I knew
she wasn't gonna come.

00:03:26.915 --> 00:03:29.084
I haven't seen my mum
in seven years.

00:03:32.254 --> 00:03:33.797
There has been some contact,

00:03:33.881 --> 00:03:36.049
normally
on a withheld number.

00:03:36.133 --> 00:03:39.136
If I want to call her,
they don't pick up.

00:03:39.219 --> 00:03:40.512
And, in my belief,

00:03:40.596 --> 00:03:42.890
the conversations
have all been scripted.

00:03:43.974 --> 00:03:47.811
Just feels like
I'm speaking to a robot.

00:03:49.104 --> 00:03:51.899
To this day I don't actually
know where she is.

00:03:52.566 --> 00:03:53.400
I mean...

00:03:54.401 --> 00:03:57.529
She's never once allowed me
to know where she lives.

00:03:57.613 --> 00:03:58.614
What's that?

00:03:59.198 --> 00:04:01.533
My mum was a loving,
caring woman.

00:04:02.409 --> 00:04:04.161
And it just seems that

00:04:04.244 --> 00:04:06.622
there's someone there
pulling the strings.

00:04:07.206 --> 00:04:10.417
I believe the person behind
all of this is Freegard.

